WEBVTT

00:05:28.115 --> 00:05:31.744
There are, however,
a tiny handful of people

00:05:31.786 --> 00:05:34.413
who do understand
and are trying to address this.

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:36.207
Here's a few of them.

00:05:36.707 --> 00:05:37.917
In France,

00:05:37.917 --> 00:05:43.631
Sou Fujimoto has designed this
amazingly textured apartment building.

00:05:44.465 --> 00:05:46.550
In Burkina Faso,

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:50.805
Francis Kéré has made
this soulful health center.

00:05:51.389 --> 00:05:52.807
In Lebanon,

00:05:52.848 --> 00:05:58.354
Lina Ghotmeh Architecture
has been using splendidly thick walls

00:05:58.396 --> 00:06:00.523
to make characterful housing.